# Gnomad engines (FW-SWAP): track 1 on the Gnomad VA through the synth's own controls, played on its keys
at 1.0 button HOME down
+0 button SAVE down
+2.5 button SAVE up
+0 button HOME up
+1.0 button SAVE
+0.3 button SAVE
+0.3 button SAVE
+0.3 button SAVE
+0.5 shot sounds-analog
+0.2 turn KNOB2 -5 over 0.5
+0.8 shot sounds-va
+0.2 button HOME
+0.6 shot track1-va
+0.4 log key C4 on track 1
+0 key C4 0.6
+0.3 shot playing
+1.2 shot after
+0.5 end
